a trait. <code>Pop\Dispatch\ConsoleTrait</code> supplies a constructor taking the application and a
<code>Pop\Console\Console</code>, the second defaulted, so <code>$this-&gt;console</code> and <code>$this-&gt;application</code> are both there:</p>
